1
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,520
Part 4 of this course asked one kind of
question fifteen times: where is it stored,

2
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:13,178
what reads it, and what happens
when it is stale or missing?

3
00:00:13,218 --> 00:00:18,116
Gate 5, the mastery test for this part,
asks the same question, and it asks it of

4
00:00:18,156 --> 00:00:19,457
