Four commands will replace it.

9
00:00:38,486 --> 00:00:42,167
Welcome back to Git and GitHub
Deep Mastery. Pull up a chair.

10
00:00:42,207 --> 00:00:47,230
This is a briefing, not a lesson. It tells
you what Gate 5 covers, how it's scored,

11
00:00:47,270 --> 00:00:52,293
