18
00:01:14,877 --> 00:01:19,541
Prepare by explaining each storage structure
as "what it stores, what reads it, what

19
00:01:19,581 --> 00:01:21,613
happens when it is stale or missing".

20
00:01:21,953 --> 00:01:25,342
Run the hands-on part with plumbing
