which objects, refs, files or rules are

27
00:01:56,788 --> 00:01:59,452
involved, and what reads or writes them.

28
00:01:59,792 --> 00:02:05,130
Part 2, Prediction: 20 points, four items.
You get the commands that built a state,

29
00:02:05,170 --> 00:02:09,342
