34
00:02:25,122 --> 00:02:30,261
Part 4, Oral interview: 20 points, six
questions asked one at a time, each with a

35
00:02:30,301 --> 00:02:33,394
follow-up, spoken, with
no terminal and no notes.

36
00:02:33,734 --> 00:02:39,857
The pass rule has two conditions. The
threshold overall, 85 here, and at least 70

