39
00:02:51,919 --> 00:02:53,249
percent is a miss.

40
00:02:53,589 --> 00:02:58,908
How the hands-on part runs. From the course
root you run the generator of variant A,

41
00:02:58,948 --> 00:03:03,757
and it prints the path of the sandbox.
You open the lab shell there and read

42
00:03:03,797 --> 00:03:09,052
SYMPTOMS.md. You don't read generate.sh,
which is the answer to "what happened", or

43
00:03:09,092 --> 00:03:12,178
check.sh, which lists the
end state line by line.

44
00:03:12,518 --> 00:03:17,507
You keep a log of every command. When
you think you're done, you run check.sh.

45
00:03:17,547 --> 00:03:22,859
The generator uses the fixed lab clock, so
the commit IDs in your sandbox equal the

46
00:03:22,899 --> 00:03:28,211
