114
00:08:47,992 --> 00:08:51,716
In that hour you wouldn't open
files under .git with an editor.

115
00:08:51,756 --> 00:08:56,735
You'd count objects, list refs through Git,
run git fsck, decide what is primary and

116
00:08:56,775 --> 00:09:00,977
what is derived, and repair only
derived data without a second thought.

117
00:09:01,017 --> 00:09:03,726
Part 3 of the gate is
that hour, in a sandbox.

